 ],
 "literal": "Listen, may you live, friend! Standing before him, / \"Do not go in this shivering cold,\" / if we had said, would he have gone? / Near the river, the dark-winged, beautiful-winged, / long-legged kananthul bird, warning of human presence, / makes the wayfarers traveling the path turn back their weapons, / crossing such a mountainous forest, / he who separated from us, bound by impermanent wealth.",
 "translation": "Listen, my friend, may you live! If we had stood before him and said, 'Do not go in this shivering cold,' would he have gone? He who has departed, bound by the desire for impermanent wealth, crossing the mountainous forest where the long-legged, dark-winged, beautiful kananthul bird, nesting near the river, warns of human presence and makes wayfarers traveling the path turn back their weapons in fear.",
 "modern": "தோழியே, கேள்! நீ வாழ்க! நாம் தலைவன் முன்னால் நின்று, 'இந்தக் கடுமையான குளிரில் செல்ல வேண்டாம்' என்று சொல்லியிருந்தால், அவர் சென்றிருப்பாரோ? ஆற்றின் பக்கத்தில் இருக்கும், கரிய கூட்டமான அழகிய சிறகுகளையும் நீண்ட கால்களையும் உடைய கணந்துள் பறவை, மனிதர்களின் நடமாட்டத்தை அறிந்து எச்சரித்துக் கத்துவதால், வழியில் செல்லும் புதிய பயணிகள் தங்கள் ஆயுதங்களை ஏந்தித் திரும்பச் செய்யும் மலையையுடைய காட்டின் வழியே கடந்து, நிலையற்ற பொருளின் மீதுள்ள பற்றினால் நம்மைப் பிரிந்து சென்றாரே!",
 "explanation": "The friend (tōḻi) is speaking to the heroine (talaivi) to console her during the separation. The hero has departed to earn wealth, traversing a dangerous desert/mountain path (pālai). The friend reflects on whether they could have stopped him by pleading with him before he left. She describes the perilous path he is traveling: a mountainous forest where the kananthul bird (bronze-winged jacana) makes a loud warning cry at the sight of humans, causing travelers to suspect bandits and turn back with weapons drawn. This vivid image of the dangerous path highlights the hero's determination to acquire wealth, which the friend notes is ultimately \"impermanent\" (nilaiyā poruḷ). By questioning whether he would have stayed if they had begged him, she gently consoles the heroine, suggesting that his quest for wealth was an unavoidable duty.",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
 "generated": "2026-11-26"
}